<title>USA: TABLE - Boykin Lodging Co Q2 net increases.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Boykin Lodging Co Q2 net increases.</headline>
<dateline>CLEVELAND 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unaudited Statements of Operations</p>
<p>	 (In thousands, except per share and statistical data)</p>
<p>	   For the three months ended  For the six months ended</p>
<p>					  June 30,	    June 30,</p>
<p>				   1997    1996	    1997    1996</p>
<p>					   Pro forma(a)   Pro forma(a)</p>
<p>   Total revenue	    9,728   7,522	  17,167  13,922</p>
<p> Net Income		   4,374   3,515	   7,754   6,122</p>
<p> Net income per share	0.46    0.37	    0.81    0.64</p>
<p>Weighted average common</p>
<p>   shares outstanding     9,516   9,516	   9,516   9,516</p>
<p>NOTE: (a)  1996 pro forma numbers reflect results of the Initial Hotel Portfolio only.</p>
<p>In the headline &quot;net&quot; refers to &quot;pro forma(a) net.&quot;</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
